<title>USA: IBM unveils Seascape.</title>
<headline>IBM unveils Seascape.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Business Machines Corp on Monday unveiled its new network storage product called Seascape, a computer architecture that uses an industry-standard server to help companies quickly deploy new or improved applications.</p>
<p>In a statement, IBM said soon it plans to introduce another industry-leading Seascape solution for open systems environments.</p>
